// Outturn and Plan by Spending Review group in 2024-25, as the signed-in user sees them. A user who holds only part of a
// group has the outturn of their department and a blank plan for the group.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group],
    TREATAS ( { "2024-25" }, 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year] ),
    "outturn", [Outturn],
    "plan", [Plan]
)
ORDER BY 'Spending Review Group'[Spending Review Group]
